{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 9740330141510605714,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Calculating the determinant of a matrix by Gauss",
      "source_hash": 4086318075199894692,
      "context_hash": 4861263529565875224,
      "translation": "Gauss 방법을 이용한 행렬식 계산",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:41:12.548513Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Problem: Given a matrix $A$ of size $N \\times N$.",
      "source_hash": 11152017490592368821,
      "context_hash": 17335307962722214518,
      "translation": "문제: 크기가 $N \\times N$인 행렬 $A$가 주어집니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:41:12.548515Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Compute its determinant.",
      "source_hash": 18041203907589625353,
      "context_hash": 2149928403492520922,
      "translation": "이 행렬의 행렬식을 계산하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:41:12.548515Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Algorithm",
      "source_hash": 1302133540553668709,
      "context_hash": 1261279571811290165,
      "translation": "알고리즘",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:41:12.548516Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "We use the ideas of [Gauss method for solving systems of linear equations](linear-system-gauss.md)",
      "source_hash": 14800124118257928921,
      "context_hash": 17763061242758874059,
      "translation": "[연립 선형 방정식을 푸는 Gauss 방법](linear-system-gauss.md)의 아이디어를 사용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:41:12.548516Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "We will perform the same steps as in the solution of systems of linear equations, excluding only the division of the current line to $a_{ij}$.",
      "source_hash": 6702567824640964043,
      "context_hash": 4282823437383593880,
      "translation": "연립 선형 방정식을 풀 때와 같은 단계를 수행하되, 현재 행을 $a_{ij}$로 나누는 과정만 제외합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:41:12.548517Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "These operations will not change the absolute value of the determinant of the matrix.",
      "source_hash": 1982316667395181114,
      "context_hash": 13880011076566912378,
      "translation": "이 연산들은 행렬식의 절댓값을 바꾸지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:41:12.548518Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:2",
      "source": "When we exchange two lines of the matrix, however, the sign of the determinant can change.",
      "source_hash": 16223437485682976456,
      "context_hash": 6303360302405827816,
      "translation": "그러나 행렬의 두 행을 교환하면 행렬식의 부호가 바뀔 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:41:12.548518Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "After applying Gauss on the matrix, we receive a diagonal matrix, whose determinant is just the product of the elements on the diagonal.",
      "source_hash": 2742998150410793827,
      "context_hash": 14938295585979386456,
      "translation": "행렬에 Gauss 방법을 적용하면 대각 행렬을 얻게 되며, 그 행렬식은 대각선 위 원소들의 곱과 같습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:41:12.548519Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "The sign, as previously mentioned, can be determined by the number of exchanged rows (if odd, then the sign of the determinant should be reversed).",
      "source_hash": 8305822701795514043,
      "context_hash": 13949740106612055192,
      "translation": "앞서 언급했듯이, 부호는 교환한 행의 수로 결정할 수 있습니다(홀수이면 행렬식의 부호를 반대로 바꿔야 합니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:41:12.548519Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:2",
      "source": "Thus, we can use the Gauss algorithm to compute the determinant of the matrix in complexity $O(N^3)$.",
      "source_hash": 10074234874043839185,
      "context_hash": 11921518551774949154,
      "translation": "따라서 Gauss 알고리즘을 사용하면 행렬의 행렬식을 $O(N^3)$의 복잡도로 계산할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "complexity": "복잡도"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:41:12.548520Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "It should be noted that if at some point, we do not find non-zero cell in current column, the algorithm should stop and returns 0.",
      "source_hash": 9681390677890885670,
      "context_hash": 17863505847188859526,
      "translation": "어느 시점에서든 현재 열에서 0이 아닌 칸을 찾지 못하면 알고리즘을 멈추고 0을 반환해야 한다는 점에 유의하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:41:12.548521Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Implementation",
      "source_hash": 14188291987651099077,
      "context_hash": 8856761306913428118,
      "translation": "구현",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-24T11:41:12.548521Z",
      "issues": []
    },
